        <div class="decision-q">I already have a HAR file and want to generate a script with correlations</div>
        <div class="decision-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="decision-a tc-purple-a">
          <span class="decision-tool">🧪 Script Studio</span>
          <span class="decision-hint">Upload 1 HAR for basic correlation. Record the journey twice and upload 2 HARs for deeper, more complete correlation.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer for home panel -->
